  [38;5;153mTABLE users DROP COLUMN notes[39m permanently deletes whatever text is in that column for all 48,000 rows. There is no
  rollback — SQLite's drop is not reversible, and a down-migration could only recreate an empty column. "We stopped
  using it" tells me no code reads it; it doesn't tell me the stored values are expendable.

